WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.574
Welcome to MarketCompass.

2
00:00:01.574 --> 00:00:09.167
This tour introduces three ways to follow the markets: the Dashboard, the compact Widget and the

3
00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:10.591
browser toolbar Popup.

4
00:00:10.591 --> 00:00:13.438
The Pro interface is shown here.

5
00:00:13.438 --> 00:00:17.709
Some features and allowances differ between Free and Pro.

6
00:00:17.709 --> 00:00:20.557
Let's start with the bigger picture.

7
00:00:20.957 --> 00:00:24.562
The Dashboard is your full-page workspace.

8
00:00:24.562 --> 00:00:32.373
Explore major indices and asset classes, review historical performance, and bring your watchlists

9
00:00:32.373 --> 00:00:34.776
and portfolio tools together.

10
00:00:34.776 --> 00:00:40.184
MarketCompass covers stocks, bonds, exchange-traded funds, mutual funds, commodities,

11
00:00:40.184 --> 00:00:42.587
cryptocurrencies, currencies and indices.

12
00:00:42.587 --> 00:00:50.398
Selected private-company information, financial news and a calendar add context to your research.

13
00:00:50.798 --> 00:00:55.373
Use watchlists to organize the assets you want to follow.

14
00:00:55.373 --> 00:00:59.491
Free provides one watchlist with up to fifteen assets.

15
00:00:59.491 --> 00:01:07.727
Pro supports up to ten watchlists, with up to fifty assets per list and one hundred entries across

16
00:01:07.727 --> 00:01:08.642
all lists.

17
00:01:08.642 --> 00:01:15.048
Price-target alerts are available in Free; Pro adds percentage alerts and a larger active-alert

18
00:01:15.048 --> 00:01:15.505
allowance.

19
00:01:15.905 --> 00:01:21.563
The Widget gives you a separate, compact window for your market overview and watchlists.

20
00:01:21.563 --> 00:01:26.816
Keep it beside your other work when you don't need the full Dashboard.

21
00:01:26.816 --> 00:01:30.857
Its charts and controls are designed for a smaller space.

22
00:01:30.857 --> 00:01:37.322
This is a different view of the same workspace, not a separate set of saved data.

23
00:01:37.722 --> 00:01:43.056
For a quick check, use the Popup from your browser toolbar.

24
00:01:43.056 --> 00:01:46.935
It provides compact access to watchlists and tools.

25
00:01:46.935 --> 00:01:52.754
The Dashboard, Widget and Popup share data within the same browser profile.

26
00:01:52.754 --> 00:01:59.058
That does not mean your data automatically synchronizes across different devices or browser

27
00:01:59.058 --> 00:01:59.543
profiles.

28
00:01:59.943 --> 00:02:03.617
Free includes one portfolio and asset-class allocation.

29
00:02:03.617 --> 00:02:10.966
Pro expands portfolio capacity and adds recording and editing of transactions, plus allocation by

30
00:02:10.966 --> 00:02:13.066
holding, currency and concentration.

31
00:02:13.066 --> 00:02:15.690
Transaction accounting uses average cost.

32
00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:23.563
MarketCompass helps you organize and review information; it does not connect to a brokerage or

33
00:02:23.563 --> 00:02:28.287
execute trades, and it is not a tax-filing service.

34
00:02:28.687 --> 00:02:34.444
Coverage, historical periods and update frequency depend on the source and asset.

35
00:02:34.444 --> 00:02:38.282
Some feeds require your own provider API key.

36
00:02:38.282 --> 00:02:45.478
Pro does not turn every source into a real-time feed, include a data-provider subscription, or

37
00:02:45.478 --> 00:02:47.396
unlock restricted provider data.

38
00:02:47.396 --> 00:02:52.673
Daily and reference values should not be treated as live quotes.

39
00:02:53.073 --> 00:03:00.463
Start with Free, then choose Pro if you need more capacity and deeper portfolio tools.

40
00:03:00.463 --> 00:03:08.346
Find MarketCompass in the official Chrome and Edge extension stores, or visit the website to compare

41
00:03:08.346 --> 00:03:08.838
plans.

42
00:03:08.838 --> 00:03:11.301
Financial information, not investment advice.

43
00:03:11.301 --> 00:03:11.794
MarketCompass.

44
00:03:11.794 --> 00:03:13.272
Find your bearings.

45
00:03:13.272 --> 00:03:14.750
Keep your focus.

